</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "mainEntity": [{
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What is Audible?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Audible is the worldâs largest producer and provider of spoken-word entertainment and audiobooks, enriching the lives of our millions of listeners every day. With our customer-centric approach to technological innovation and superior programming, Audible has reinvented a media category, and is the driving force behind todayâs audio entertainment revolution."
            }
        }, {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Is Audible free or discounted with Amazon Prime? How much does it cost?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "No. Audible is a subscription service, however some content may be heavily discounted or free for members. Members receive credits each month or year that can be used to purchase any audiobook on the site â regardless of price. An Audible membership is separate from a Prime membership. As a new Audible member, you can enroll in a free 30-day membership and after the first free month of listening, the standard monthly subscription fee is $14.95."
            }
        }, {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What do you get with Audible?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Audible members also have access to the world largest catalog of content - showcasing acclaimed authors and celebrated performers.<br><br>As an Audible member you receive many exclusive benefits such as:<ul><li>Monthly or annual credits good for anything on Audible</li><li>Two free Audible Originals every month</li><li>30% discount on purchases</li><li>Easy exchanges</li><li>Daily deals</li><li>Complimentary digital newspaper subscriptions</li></ul><br>In addition to these benefits you will also receive access to member-only sales like 2 for 1 deals, heavily-discounted titles and more. Any purchases you make will always be accessible in your Audible library."
            }
        }, {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "How can I listen to Audible audiobooks?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "You can listen to Audible with just about any device you can think of. Our free Audible app can be downloaded on iOS, Android, and Windows, and you can also download and listen on compatible Fire tablets, Kindles, Sonos devices, and more."
            }
        }, {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Is Audible free? How much does it cost?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "No. Audible is a subscription service, however some content may be heavily discounted or free for members. Members receive credits each month or year that can be used to purchase any audiobook on the site regardless of price.<br><br>As a new Audible member, you can enroll in a free 30-day membership and after the first free month of listening, the standard monthly subscription fee is $14.95."
            }
        }, {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What if you want to cancel?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Since this is a monthly subscription, you can cancel anytime."
            }
        }
        ] }
</script>

    





